The existing lib files already import with `.ts` extensions (e.g. `storage.ts` imports `./phone.ts`) and tests pass, meaning the vitest config uses `allowImportingTsExtensions` implicitly. The issue is `tsc --noEmit` in the build script doesn't have it. The right fix: add `allowImportingTsExtensions: true` to `tsconfig.json` — this requires `noEmit` or `emitDeclarationOnly`, but `tsc --noEmit` on the CLI overrides anyway.
