All done. Here's a summary of what was delivered:

**T6 — Styles and theme**
- `base.css`: full CSS reset, custom properties for warm-paper light palette and deep-sepia dark palette, system serif stack, focus rings, base element styles
- `layout.css`: phone-first single-column grid, 640px breakpoint, sticky header, nav buttons with `aria-current`, 44px tap targets, `.btn` variants, form helpers
- `directory.css`: `repeating-linear-gradient` ruled lines, alphabet index tabs, ember-glow heading accent (guarded by `prefers-reduced-motion`), emergency section, memorize badge
- `drill.css`: drill card, mono phone input, `aria-live` feedback region with correct/incorrect states, `prefers-reduced-motion` guard
- `print.css`: wallet card (`3.375×2.125in`) and fridge sheet (US Letter) in `@media print`
- `theme.ts`: reads saved pref, applies `data-theme`, cycles system→light→dark on toggle, listens to `prefers-color-scheme` changes

**T7 — Contacts UI** (`contacts.ts`): alphabetical grouping with letter headings and index tabs, emergency block (read-only), add/edit inline forms with `role="alert"` phone validation, delete confirmation, 10-contact cap, all user text via `textContent`

**T8 — Plan UI** (`plan.ts`): meeting-place and fallback inputs, restored from state on mount, `role="alert"` errors, `aria-live` save confirmation

**main.ts**: boots app, section nav with `aria-current` buttons, theme init, contacts + plan init, demo data button with `confirm()` guard

